{"steam_appid":1220150,"steam_name":"Blue Fire","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1220150/405590/18e83a0d95ecf5fa58bb4c2f3df8a4bcfada9343/1750644385/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752615722","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256853940/038487402097fa66570345523f94b2445e62c655/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752615722","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220150/ss_e2a7740082a06a3da1d5a0e50f3386b7e54edb6b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756240031","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220150/ss_f489801e915c4d0681550154f0802fb40756d57d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756240031","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220150/ss_79cc5b1e6a365ac47944ae1c4e1b462e902d8d89.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756240031","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220150/ss_1c8b41aecb1ed90caf0ed6973a710090f5d98ad3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756240031","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220150/ss_a2abf7c53fb5c47192e5dbb50f6e0368d9bd09ca.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756240031"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220150/extras/3cdaa1f2c498811d83d677101f094693.avif?t=1756240031\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the fallen kingdom of Penumbra, where only mastery of movement and combat will guide you through its mysterious ruins. Blue Fire is a 3D metroidvania platformer blending fast-paced combat, challenging precision platforming, and deep exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220150/extras/f4650716ce8fa3263c59aed80552c988.avif?t=1756240031\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Precision Platforming &amp; Movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fluid, high-speed movement to navigate deadly traps, complex platforming gauntlets, and traversal challenges that demand precision, timing, and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220150/extras/239bdaa0b5af66c15fc44f062c655e6d.poster.avif?t=1756240031\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220150/extras/239bdaa0b5af66c15fc44f062c655e6d.webm?t=1756240031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220150/extras/239bdaa0b5af66c15fc44f062c655e6d.mp4?t=1756240031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat &amp; Fierce Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face dangerous enemies with unique fighting styles in intense combat encounters. Strike, dodge, and slash while testing your skills against powerful bosses, the deadly knights of the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220150/extras/08977fce948edd192d79590ee0f7df98.poster.avif?t=1756240031\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220150/extras/08977fce948edd192d79590ee0f7df98.webm?t=1756240031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220150/extras/08977fce948edd192d79590ee0f7df98.mp4?t=1756240031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Voids: Ultimate Platforming Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover mysterious Void entrances hidden across Penumbra. Enter surreal platforming trials that push your movement skills to the limit, offering great rewards for those who survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220150/extras/445685d412604f7c2b392d71e654e4e2.poster.avif?t=1756240031\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220150/extras/445685d412604f7c2b392d71e654e4e2.webm?t=1756240031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim powerful swords, hidden spirits, and valuable loot. Upgrade your gear, unlock new abilities, and customize your build to face ever-deadlier foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220150/extras/2c34d8d9d634ab51a2ce97d762712ad8.poster.avif?t=1756240031\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220150/extras/2c34d8d9d634ab51a2ce97d762712ad8.webm?t=1756240031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Blue Fire delivers a deadly yet rewarding adventure where every jump, slash, and dodge counts. The mysterious world of Penumbra awaits.</strong></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit, Dual Core 3.0GHz processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11 or DirectX 12 compatible graphics card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD, 3.0 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11 or DirectX 12 compatible graphics card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Robi Studios"],"publishers":["Graffiti Games"],"release_date":"4 Feb, 2021"}